---
# The playbooks are deliberately-styled hand-invoked scaffolding (see
# CLAUDE.md's "Ansible playbook notes"), not yet the target design --
# mid-string Jinja in task names and run_once in the batch-summary tasks
# are intentional there, not lint debt. Gate on `min` (real bugs: syntax,
# undefined vars, deprecated syntax) rather than `basic`'s style opinions.
profile: min
exclude_paths:
  - .venv/
